1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,200
 "We love missionaries of all ages.

2
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:09,440
 You are an army of righteousness with the doctrine of Christ as your purpose.

3
00:00:09,440 --> 00:00:14,160
 You are a force of faith, power, love, and joy.

4
00:00:14,160 --> 00:00:16,320
 You are what you preach.

5
00:00:16,320 --> 00:00:22,140
 You're not only messengers, but also living examples of the message.

6
00:00:22,140 --> 00:00:28,760
 Make no mistake, you are doing the most important work you could be doing.

7
00:00:28,760 --> 00:00:33,840
 We thank you for building up the kingdom of God on earth.

8
00:00:33,840 --> 00:00:35,920
 A few months ago, I attended a ceremony.

